{% set posts = page.posts.toArray() %}
<section class="notebook-cover">
  <div class="notebook-cover__margin">20</div>
  <div class="notebook-cover__content">
    <p class="note-label">PERSONAL NOTEBOOK / 2026</p>
    <h1>Make room<br><span>for wonder.</span></h1>
    <p class="cover-intro">技术、工具、阅读和生活里的未完成思考。这里不追求结论，只记录那些值得留下的东西。</p>
    <div class="cover-meta"><span>SHANGHAI / CN</span><span>OPEN SINCE 2019</span><span>✎</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="notebook-cover__corner">LYYD'S<br>NOTEBOOK</div>
</section>

<section class="notebook-dashboard" id="writing">
  <div class="section-heading"><span>01 / RECENT NOTES</span><a href="{{ url_for('/articles/') }}">VIEW ALL →</a></div>
  {% if posts.length %}
    {% set featured = posts[0] %}
    <div class="note-feature">
      <div class="note-feature__pin">FEATURED</div>
      <div class="note-feature__body">
        <span class="note-date">{{ date(featured.date, 'YYYY.MM.DD') }} / NOTE</span>
        <h2><a href="{{ url_for(featured.path) }}">{{ featured.title }}</a></h2>
        <p>{% if featured.excerpt %}{{ strip_html(featured.excerpt) }}{% else %}{{ strip_html(truncate(featured.content, {length: 220, separator: ' '})) }}{% endif %}</p>
        <a class="read-link" href="{{ url_for(featured.path) }}">READ THE NOTE ↗</a>
      </div>
      <div class="note-feature__scribble">keep<br>looking<br>closer</div>
    </div>

    <div class="note-list">
      {% for post in posts.slice(1, 7) %}
        <a class="note-row" href="{{ url_for(post.path) }}">
          <span class="note-row__number">{{ loop.index + 1 }}</span>
          <span class="note-row__date">{{ date(post.date, 'MM.DD') }}</span>
          <strong>{{ post.title }}</strong>
          <span class="note-row__arrow">↗</span>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  {% else %}
    <p class="empty-note">还没有公开的笔记。</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section class="notebook-lower">
  <div class="paper-note paper-note--yellow">
    <span class="note-label">CURRENTLY</span>
    <h3>Building smaller tools.</h3>
    <p>把复杂问题拆小一点，把注意力留给真正重要的部分。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="paper-note paper-note--blue">
    <span class="note-label">INDEX</span>
    <div class="index-links"><a href="{{ url_for('/archives/') }}">Archives ↗</a><a href="{{ url_for('/categories/') }}">Categories ↗</a><a href="{{ url_for('/tags/') }}">Tags ↗</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="paper-note paper-note--red">
    <span class="note-label">A SMALL RULE</span>
    <p>写下能帮助未来的自己的东西。</p>
    <span class="signature">— L</span>
  </div>
</section>
